- How would TTL tuning per region impact global latency and cache efficiency?

## Why This Is Asked
Tests real-time streaming with backpressure and autoscaling in a realistic traffic pattern.

## Key Concepts
- WebSocket load testing for 100k connections
- End-to-end latency budgets and backlog under burst
- Autoscaling triggers and cross-service coupling
- Backpressure, burst tolerance, and fault-injection

